				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">I am tired of the catch phrase that Dems have latched on to: "Bush lied, WMD where are they?" At this point I doin't think the horse needs to be beaten till the pulp is into singular atoms. It's dead already! Ok we all get it geees. 
