<br />

<br />
I think that the short sighted folks who have never sacrificed anything spend way too much time worrying over squirls and owls and not enough time worrying over human beings. I guess we are over-populated and all.
<br />

<br />
But I digress.
<br />

<br />
Freedom has a cost all generations up to the Vietnam War seems to have known that. History will tell whether we were right to do what we have done in Iraq but for now I side with our President. 
<br />

<br />
Democrats need to realize that saying the samething over and over seems like brain washing to me.<br />_________________<br />Darerisk Bloodblighter (Mother always said, "Evil is as evil does , and you my son is EVIL!")
